mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动Seed部门完成组织架构调整，重构预训练、强化学习与Agent研发</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI全面开源Codex Harness，开放AI编程智能体底层运行框架</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic在Claude Platform正式上线Computer Use、Skills API与Files API</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴开源 Qwen-UI-Agent 真机多模态 GUI 智能体基座模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9441ff3cea1797e0f581040dd68e13eb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴正式开源 GUI 智能体基座模型 Qwen-UI-Agent，旨在实现移动端、电脑端、网页端及深度搜索环境下的真实设备操作。该模型在 MobileWorld 测试中斩获 82.1% 分数，在自建百台真机基准 MobileWorld-Real 上成功率达 92.2%，并于 OSWorld-Verified 取得 79.5% 成绩，WebArena 排名位列第一。Qwen-UI-Agent 搭建了覆盖 150 多个应用的真机环境，支持批量动作输出以缩短执行轨迹，并具备超 100 步长程任务的在线强化学习能力。在安全性方面，模型内置全过程判断机制，针对支付、隐私授权等敏感场景执行主动拦截与确认。该模型通过支持命令行操作与自适应课程学习，有效提升了复杂真实环境下的任务执行效率与安全性，为开发者提供从模拟走向真实</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云千问AI平台接入GLM-5.3与DeepSeek-V4-Pro模型并开放API</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/368aa05201c9aff87be2716b08304668.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里云千问AI平台（MaaS）近日完成模型矩阵升级，正式上线智谱GLM-5.3与DeepSeek-V4-Pro旗舰模型，并同步开放配套API服务。GLM-5.3重点强化了编程、长程任务执行及网络安全能力；DeepSeek-V4-Pro则针对智能体交互进行深度优化，适配代码开发与多步骤复杂任务处理。目前，千问AI平台已覆盖文本、代码、语音、图像及视频五大生成式AI赛道，聚合了Qwen3.8-Max、Qwen-Audio3.0、Kimi K3等主流模型。在商业化层面，平台推出Token Plan套餐服务，支持用户在Qoder、Codex等开发工具内灵活切换模型。此次更新进一步完善了平台的全场景模型供给，为开发者与企业用户提供更丰富的选型空间，加速智能体及代码开发类应用的落地进程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动Seed部门完成组织架构调整，重构预训练、强化学习与Agent研发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8cb4e67f91eb28ea66ed5002db0c70ff.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动大模型部门Seed于上周完成新一轮组织调整，新设四个一级部门，全面重构预训练、强化学习及Agent研发链路。此次调整将B端与C端产品模型能力进行差异化布局：Pretrain Data部门由李成刚负责，统一管理多模态及超大模型预训练数据；Horizon RL部门由唐晟宇负责，重点推进强化学习以提升模型基础智能上限。在产品后训练层面，Product Posttrain-Work部门由秦禹嘉负责，专注于B端办公场景的Agentic模型整合与能力优化，支撑豆包、Dola等产品的任务模式；原Application团队更名为Product Posttrain-Chat，由朱文佳负责，继续深耕C端对话模型。通过此次架构重组，Seed旨在强化从数据到模型后训练的全链路研发效率，并针对企业级Agent与消费级对话场景建立</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI全面开源Codex Harness，开放AI编程智能体底层运行框架</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3dc7558b6757f99938aa45834da1392c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日全面开源Codex Harness，将驱动Codex智能体运行的核心框架向开发者开放。Codex Harness作为连接模型、用户与工具的Agent执行环境，负责管理任务执行、上下文、会话及代码操作流程。该框架核心组件包括Agent Loop、线程生命周期管理、持久化、身份认证及工具扩展机制。开发者可通过Codex App Server利用双向JSON-RPC协议将Harness接入IDE、桌面应用等客户端，并获取实时事件流。目前，该框架已支撑Codex Web、CLI及macOS应用等场景。OpenAI内部实践显示，基于Harness的工程模式可实现“人类设定目标、Agent执行”的开发闭环。此次开源标志着AI编程竞争从单纯的模型能力转向Agent运行时、工具调用及工程反馈闭环的标准化，助力开</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic在Claude Platform正式上线Computer Use、Skills API与Files API</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/080fe9189b1afd9bb85fd10d4f20ed83.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic宣布Claude Platform的Computer Use、Skills API及Files API正式进入全面可用（GA）阶段。核心升级包括：Computer Use功能支持单轮次执行多项连续动作，并符合HIPAA标准，可用于受监管的医疗工作负载。新增的浏览器使用工具（Browser use tool）具备网页结构解析能力，能精准识别并操作网页元素。Skills API允许企业在代码执行沙盒中管理并运行专属技能指令与脚本；Files API则提供1TB专属存储空间，支持PDF及电子表格上传，速率限制提升至原先的5倍，并引入自动过期机制。此次更新旨在赋能企业构建生产级智能体（Production Agents）。此外，除Microsoft Foundry外，电脑操作与浏览器使用工具即将登陆G</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
